    <string name="flick_rink_title">Flick Rink</string>
    <string name="flick_rink_help_title">How to play Flick Rink</string>
    <string name="flick_rink_help_text">Drag back and let go to flick your puck pal across the ice. Slide over the fish to pick it up, then flick home and stop inside the igloo ring to bank it. Walls bounce you, puddles splash you back to where you started, and bumping friends is fine. Take turns until three fish are home.</string>
    <string name="flick_rink_tut_1">Meet your puck pal! Drag back, then let go to flick it.</string>
    <string name="flick_rink_tut_2">The farther you drag, the harder the flick.</string>
    <string name="flick_rink_tut_3">Slide over the fish to pick it up.</string>
    <string name="flick_rink_tut_4">Now flick home and stop inside the igloo ring.</string>
    <string name="flick_rink_tut_5">Walls bounce you. Puddles splash you back. Bumping friends is fine!</string>
    <string name="flick_rink_tut_6_turns">Take turns. Bring three fish home to win the rink!</string>
    <string name="flick_rink_tut_6_coop">Bring three fish home together before the flicks run out!</string>
    <string name="flick_rink_tut_7">You are ready! Tap Play.</string>
